---
import './Mechanism.css';
---

<section class="mechanism paper-field" id="workflow" aria-labelledby="mechanism-title">
  <div class="mechanism-inner">
    <header class="mechanism-intro">
      <h2 id="mechanism-title">From your website to your next campaign.</h2>
    </header>

    <ol class="process-timeline" aria-label="The proposed Austi marketing workflow">
      <li>
        <span>01</span>
        <div>
          <h3>Start with your brand</h3>
          <p>Share your website, your audience and what you want to promote. Give Austi the voice, products and references that make your business yours.</p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span>02</span>
        <div>
          <h3>Build the campaign</h3>
          <p>Bring the idea into focus with a content plan, then draft the ads, posts, emails and search content around the same message.</p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span>03</span>
        <div>
          <h3>Review. Refine. Make it yours.</h3>
          <p>Check the copy, adjust the angle and approve what fits. Take the finished content to your channels, with publishing connections being explored during early access.</p>
        </div>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>
